1
00:00:00,447 --> 00:00:01,907
(Penny:)Another night?

2
00:00:02,074 --> 00:00:03,954
(Penny:)Well, I guess you can try...

3
00:00:04,118 --> 00:00:09,878
(Penny:)...but deep inside your heart you'll know
that laundry night is always Saturday night.

4
00:00:14,336 --> 00:00:17,966
(Sheldon:)Woman, you are playing with forces
beyond your ken.

5
00:00:18,424 --> 00:00:21,174
(Penny:)Yeah, well,
your Ken can kiss my Barbie.

6
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,140
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

7
00:00:27,308 --> 00:00:29,138
Sheldon? Sheldon?

8
00:00:33,522 --> 00:00:34,942
(Sheldon:)Yes?

9
00:00:35,274 --> 00:00:36,524
(Penny:)Where are my clothes?

10
00:00:36,692 --> 00:00:38,982
- Your clothes?
- Yes. I left them in the washers.

11
00:00:39,153 --> 00:00:41,033
I went to get them,
they were gone.

12
00:00:41,196 --> 00:00:47,116
Really? Despite the sign that says:
"Do not leave laundry unattended"?

13
00:00:47,286 --> 00:00:49,036
(Penny:)Sheldon, where are my clothes?

14
00:00:49,204 --> 00:00:53,294
(Sheldon:)You know, I do recall
seeing some female undergarments.

15
00:00:53,459 --> 00:00:55,879
(Sheldon:)Where was that? Oh, yes.

16
00:00:56,045 --> 00:00:57,625
(Sheldon:)Earlier this evening...

